the-firm-as-one-program-5 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-5 = unlines (cons "- **O2** First, of the CitSec and Jane Street superorganisms, the human element: the upper echelon of engineering and computer-science talent, concentrated in one superorganism around a well-defined problem: make money with machines." (cons "  - **O2.1** Most organizations dilute talent across vague goals; these point all of it at one unambiguous objective." (cons "  - **O2.2** Every idea is tested against PnL within days: an unusually tight and honest feedback loop on intelligence." (cons "  - **O2.3** So every part of computer science is pushed to its limit here under one measure: compilers, distributed systems, hardware, numerics, networking, formal reasoning. See [O7: Nothing in computer science is not developed fully here; this was the three-year study of the industry before execution. Optimization, end-to-end optimization]." nil))))
